WEBVTT

00:00:01.590 --> 00:00:06.010
Chapter 20

00:00:01.590 --> 00:00:06.010
Beloved One

00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:21.060
Alicia!

00:00:22.140 --> 00:00:25.380
Could you put in an order to replenish our medical supplies?

00:00:25.380 --> 00:00:26.880
Okay, I will.

00:00:28.770 --> 00:00:32.090
I... Alicia...

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:35.930
Relieved from command of the invasion of Gallia?

00:00:35.930 --> 00:00:37.900
How did this happen?

00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:43.690
Are the guys over at Central telling us to stop the invasion?

00:00:43.690 --> 00:00:45.230
Exactly.

00:00:45.700 --> 00:00:47.690
Listen carefully, Maximilian.

00:00:47.690 --> 00:00:52.710
We cannot afford to use so many resources just to invade a country like Gallia.

00:00:52.710 --> 00:00:58.200
We must concentrate every last bit of our military strength on fighting the Federation.

00:00:58.650 --> 00:00:59.910
Understood?

00:00:59.910 --> 00:01:06.550
We thought that you should be relieved of command over the invasion of Gallia.

00:01:07.740 --> 00:01:11.720
This will most likely occur within a month,

00:01:11.720 --> 00:01:13.760
meaning they will take away my position as commander.

00:01:13.760 --> 00:01:15.100
That's...

00:01:15.100 --> 00:01:21.440
Oh, man. I never thought we'd be chased out by our own people, rather than by enemy forces.

00:01:21.440 --> 00:01:23.100
What irony.

00:01:23.730 --> 00:01:25.660
There's no helping it.

00:01:25.660 --> 00:01:30.490
Considering our results so far, plus the fact that we lost Gregor...

00:01:30.490 --> 00:01:33.320
It's inevitable that my standing would be in question.

00:01:34.570 --> 00:01:36.890
So? What should we do then?

00:01:37.520 --> 00:01:40.240
You wouldn't follow their orders so obediently, would you?

00:01:40.800 --> 00:01:42.260
Of course not.

00:01:47.540 --> 00:01:50.290
We're going to use it after all?

00:01:58.600 --> 00:02:01.890
All right. It's okay now.

00:02:08.190 --> 00:02:10.430
Who are you again?

00:02:10.430 --> 00:02:12.650
You aren't from Squad 7, are you?

00:02:12.650 --> 00:02:15.820
I-I'm from Squad 1.

00:02:15.820 --> 00:02:17.960
What are you doing here?

00:02:17.960 --> 00:02:20.240
I'm doing a bit of maintenance on this.

00:02:25.240 --> 00:02:27.410
This tank is amazing.

00:02:27.850 --> 00:02:30.720
I've been on many tanks before,

00:02:30.720 --> 00:02:34.330
but this is the first time I've seen one that's been so well cared for.

00:02:34.880 --> 00:02:36.480
Of course!

00:02:37.740 --> 00:02:39.310
What?

00:02:39.310 --> 00:02:40.680
What's the matter?

00:02:40.680 --> 00:02:42.140
Was someone here?

00:02:42.140 --> 00:02:44.900
Some kid from Squad 1.

00:02:44.900 --> 00:02:47.960
He flared at me just like a pubescent boy would.

00:02:47.960 --> 00:02:49.850
The hell was that?

00:02:52.060 --> 00:02:53.770
Indeed...

00:03:02.750 --> 00:03:04.040
Commander.

00:03:04.040 --> 00:03:05.950
Ramal! You were here?

00:03:05.950 --> 00:03:08.340
Sorry. I didn't notice you.

00:03:08.340 --> 00:03:09.370
It's all right.

00:03:09.900 --> 00:03:12.080
You don't have to salute me here.

00:03:12.640 --> 00:03:15.170
I was thinking about some stuff, so it's the same with me.

00:03:15.170 --> 00:03:16.340
Sorry.

00:03:17.630 --> 00:03:21.110
You have worries too, commander?

00:03:21.110 --> 00:03:22.480
Of course I do.

00:03:22.480 --> 00:03:23.800
What do you think I am?

00:03:23.800 --> 00:03:24.930
No...

00:03:25.440 --> 00:03:27.330
I feel like you're different from me.

00:03:27.330 --> 00:03:31.520
You won't worry or get depressed.

00:03:33.070 --> 00:03:35.400
I'm not Superman, you know.

00:03:35.400 --> 00:03:37.820
If I'm troubled, there'll be times when I'll be down too.

00:03:38.360 --> 00:03:40.620
I'm no different from you.

00:03:41.540 --> 00:03:42.830
Really?

00:03:42.830 --> 00:03:46.780
Yeah. But I won't get depressed so easily.

00:03:46.780 --> 00:03:50.000
No matter what happens, I believe that...

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:54.170
we'll be able to solve any problem even if it takes time. Am I wrong?

00:03:56.880 --> 00:03:57.710
You're right.

00:03:58.270 --> 00:03:59.800
Please excuse me!

00:04:03.170 --> 00:04:05.850
I can't be worrying all the time.

00:04:14.000 --> 00:04:15.710
Lord Maximilian...

00:04:16.610 --> 00:04:19.190
Even if I have to sacrifice myself,

00:04:19.190 --> 00:04:21.990
I'll fulfill your plans.

00:04:21.990 --> 00:04:24.280
All troops, advance!

00:04:40.920 --> 00:04:42.710
General Jaeger.

00:04:42.710 --> 00:04:47.030
Gallia's army should be able to detect the movement of such a large body of troops.

00:04:47.030 --> 00:04:48.390
That's our objective.

00:04:50.090 --> 00:04:55.250
During the initial stages of the war with Gallia, we had them cornered.

00:04:55.250 --> 00:04:58.120
But recently, we've been pushed back.

00:04:58.120 --> 00:05:05.000
The easiest way to change the situation is to obliterate them in one decisive battle.

00:05:05.000 --> 00:05:11.960
In order to do that, we must reveal our movements to them and lure them out.

00:05:11.960 --> 00:05:13.140
I see.

00:05:14.250 --> 00:05:17.380
A decisive battle, huh?

00:05:17.380 --> 00:05:21.690
I never dreamed it would come to this.

00:05:21.690 --> 00:05:26.670
Does this mean that his influence in the military has dwindled that much?

00:05:27.970 --> 00:05:29.600
The situation is urgent.

00:05:30.160 --> 00:05:34.270
Reports have stated that the Imperial army is gathering at the Naggiar Plains.

00:05:34.830 --> 00:05:39.030
All of the invasion forces are practically gathered there. {I re-TLed this. Check it? -Ky Ok, she means that all the strength to invade Gallia is right there. -wq}

00:05:39.030 --> 00:05:45.280
Most importantly, the second crown prince, Maximilian, is personally directing this operation.

00:05:45.740 --> 00:05:49.040
In other words, they want a decisive battle?

00:05:49.040 --> 00:05:51.680
Have they finally gotten serious?

00:05:51.680 --> 00:05:53.410
Will it be okay?

00:05:55.780 --> 00:05:58.370
Perhaps we could think of it this way.

00:05:58.910 --> 00:06:03.560
They're being forced into a situation where they have no choice but to move all of their forces.

00:06:03.560 --> 00:06:04.960
Being forced to?

00:06:05.500 --> 00:06:09.570
They haven't made much progress for a while now.

00:06:09.570 --> 00:06:12.580
Moreover, they've been pushed back instead.

00:06:12.580 --> 00:06:15.510
We have the advantage, don't we?

00:06:15.510 --> 00:06:19.890
So, the Imperial army is doing this because...

00:06:19.890 --> 00:06:23.570
they want to get some results.

00:06:23.570 --> 00:06:26.720
What they want is a chance to turn the tide of battle.

00:06:26.720 --> 00:06:27.650
There's no doubt.

00:06:27.650 --> 00:06:29.430
Exactly.

00:06:29.430 --> 00:06:31.150
Although we shouldn't let our guard down,

00:06:31.150 --> 00:06:35.890
the fact is we have the advantage, as 2nd Lieutenant Gunther said.

00:06:35.890 --> 00:06:38.430
We don't have to be overly afraid.

00:06:38.430 --> 00:06:40.050
Yes, that's right.

00:06:40.050 --> 00:06:42.900
The legendary, undefeated Squad 7 has spoken.

00:06:42.900 --> 00:06:46.030
Yeah, we can fight plenty too!

00:06:49.490 --> 00:06:51.050
Commander, your orders.

00:06:52.220 --> 00:06:53.930
Have you settled your worries?

00:06:55.060 --> 00:06:56.550
What, Ramal?

00:06:56.550 --> 00:06:57.960
You were worried about something?

00:06:57.960 --> 00:07:00.450
Man, you're cold.

00:07:00.450 --> 00:07:02.290
Why didn't you share them with us?

00:07:02.290 --> 00:07:03.330
We're comrades, right?

00:07:03.330 --> 00:07:04.360
Trust us.

00:07:04.800 --> 00:07:06.030
Commander!

00:07:07.630 --> 00:07:09.250
Sorry.

00:07:09.250 --> 00:07:12.620
But you look better than you did before.

00:07:13.870 --> 00:07:15.060
That's right.

00:07:15.060 --> 00:07:18.320
We have the advantage, just as Welkin said.

00:07:18.320 --> 00:07:21.580
We can solve any problem.

00:07:22.150 --> 00:07:26.340
Even if we don't use Alicia's - the Valkyrur's power...

00:07:31.240 --> 00:07:34.300
Okay. Looks like everyone's ready.

00:07:34.720 --> 00:07:36.580
It's the moment of truth!

00:07:36.580 --> 00:07:37.570
Prepare to move out!

00:07:48.370 --> 00:07:50.530
Princess Cordelia!

00:07:50.530 --> 00:07:52.620
Where are you going?

00:07:52.620 --> 00:07:57.530
I heard that our army and the Imperial army are having an all-out war at Naggiar.

00:07:57.960 --> 00:08:00.660
I'm heading to the front lines.

00:08:00.660 --> 00:08:03.080
W-What are you saying?

00:08:03.080 --> 00:08:05.790
What can you do after going there?

00:08:05.790 --> 00:08:07.580
I don't know.

00:08:07.580 --> 00:08:08.850
Even so...

00:08:11.780 --> 00:08:12.900
Even so...

00:08:12.900 --> 00:08:15.730
There must be something I can do.

00:08:15.730 --> 00:08:21.030
If my presence can give courage to the soldiers...

00:08:22.070 --> 00:08:24.250
then that's what I must do!

00:08:35.170 --> 00:08:37.980
The battle at Naggiar has begun.

00:08:37.980 --> 00:08:40.640
This battle will determine the fate of the war.

00:08:40.640 --> 00:08:44.470
The Gallian army and the Imperial army continue to trade blows.

00:08:42.770 --> 00:08:44.470
Don't falter! Charge!

00:08:45.090 --> 00:08:47.340
With Faldio's Squad 1 as the lead,

00:08:47.340 --> 00:08:52.760
approximately half of the militia is fighting alongside the regular army on the front lines.

00:08:53.360 --> 00:08:56.680
Squad 7, as well as other squads,

00:08:56.680 --> 00:09:00.410
have been assigned supporting roles.

00:09:00.890 --> 00:09:05.620
Commander Varrot wanted Squad 7, which has distinguished itself before, to be on the front lines,

00:09:05.620 --> 00:09:08.590
but General Damon objected to it.

00:09:09.220 --> 00:09:11.630
We continued to be deployed in the rear,

00:09:11.630 --> 00:09:14.920
and we knew nothing about the battle being waged at the front.

00:09:21.470 --> 00:09:22.680
What's that?

00:09:27.360 --> 00:09:29.140
Oh, man. It's quite something.

00:09:29.700 --> 00:09:32.530
Maximilian was quite pre-emptive.

00:09:32.530 --> 00:09:37.030
That Batomys might be slower than existing tanks,

00:09:37.030 --> 00:09:40.900
but its armor is much thicker, and its cannon is more destructive as well.

00:09:41.360 --> 00:09:44.370
Now, how will the enemy react?

00:09:44.370 --> 00:09:45.740
Fire!

00:09:48.950 --> 00:09:50.780
It hit!

00:09:50.780 --> 00:09:52.750
You see that? You sluggish Imperial pigs.

00:09:56.290 --> 00:09:58.210
Just what kind of tank is it?

00:10:00.890 --> 00:10:01.910
Reporting in!

00:10:01.910 --> 00:10:06.140
Because of the attack by the enemy's large tank, Squad 2 from the regular army has been annihilated!

00:10:06.140 --> 00:10:07.650
Commander, your orders!

00:10:07.650 --> 00:10:09.060
Relax, Ramal.

00:10:11.980 --> 00:10:14.230
There should be some way...

00:10:19.060 --> 00:10:20.440
The radiator...

00:10:21.150 --> 00:10:23.150
If we hit it when it comes out...

00:10:23.630 --> 00:10:24.950
Commander...

00:10:24.950 --> 00:10:26.760
Don't worry.

00:10:26.760 --> 00:10:28.910
I won't let you guys die.

00:10:30.890 --> 00:10:32.980
Don't push yourself.

00:10:32.980 --> 00:10:34.250
All right!

00:10:34.250 --> 00:10:37.460
Everyone from the militia, gather here!

00:10:38.020 --> 00:10:41.280
The enemy will definitely change direction and head over here.

00:10:41.280 --> 00:10:43.510
We have to lure them over here first!

00:10:43.510 --> 00:10:44.590
Let's go!

00:10:51.250 --> 00:10:53.560
What's wrong, Alicia?

00:10:53.560 --> 00:10:54.780
Welkin.

00:10:54.780 --> 00:10:56.940
I know you're worried,

00:10:56.940 --> 00:10:59.670
but we should do what we can.

00:11:06.630 --> 00:11:07.950
That's...

00:11:07.950 --> 00:11:11.580
Everyone, have no fear!

00:11:12.350 --> 00:11:15.120
Our will is protected by Heaven!

00:11:17.910 --> 00:11:20.130
The spear and shield of the Valkyrur,

00:11:20.130 --> 00:11:22.410
passed down along generations in the Principality of {should we remove Principality?}Gallia,

00:11:22.410 --> 00:11:25.540
will protect everyone-

00:11:25.540 --> 00:11:28.760
No, they'll protect us from the corrupt Empire!

00:11:30.430 --> 00:11:32.010
Geez.

00:11:32.010 --> 00:11:35.510
I heard rumors, but I never thought she'd actually come to the front lines...

00:11:35.510 --> 00:11:39.810
If anything happens to her, who'd be responsible?

00:11:39.810 --> 00:11:43.900
But it's said that Princess Cordelia is a descendant of the Valkyrur.

00:11:44.360 --> 00:11:46.860
That spear and shield is proof.

00:11:46.860 --> 00:11:49.310
Valkyrur?

00:11:49.310 --> 00:11:51.830
Isn't that just a legend?

00:11:59.100 --> 00:12:00.540
What happened?

00:12:00.540 --> 00:12:04.020
Their retaliation is becoming more intense here.

00:12:04.020 --> 00:12:05.050
Really?

00:12:05.560 --> 00:12:09.390
I think it's best to have Lord Maximilian's Batomys retreat.

00:12:09.880 --> 00:12:11.600
Hold your horses.

00:12:17.340 --> 00:12:20.000
Right after it fires its main cannon,

00:12:20.000 --> 00:12:23.010
shoot at the exposed radiator!

00:12:23.010 --> 00:12:23.780
Yes, sir!

00:12:38.000 --> 00:12:39.500
Now!

00:12:47.640 --> 00:12:48.420
It stopped!

00:12:48.420 --> 00:12:50.130
Okay, it worked!

00:12:55.440 --> 00:12:56.880
There's no doubt.

00:12:56.880 --> 00:12:58.330
We have...

00:12:58.330 --> 00:13:01.150
We have the advantage!

00:13:02.180 --> 00:13:03.920
It's been a long time.

00:13:03.920 --> 00:13:06.110
Yes. How have you been?

00:13:06.630 --> 00:13:09.110
The soldiers were encouraged by your presence.

00:13:09.110 --> 00:13:11.920
They're preparing to counterattack this very moment.

00:13:11.920 --> 00:13:14.480
You came here without regards to danger...

00:13:14.480 --> 00:13:18.010
No, it's not about whether it's dangerous or not.

00:13:18.010 --> 00:13:22.630
I'm just doing what I can for Gallia. That's all.

00:13:26.490 --> 00:13:28.380
Lord Maximilian's Batomys has been...

00:13:30.310 --> 00:13:33.010
They're pretty determined all of a sudden!

00:13:41.820 --> 00:13:42.810
Go!

00:13:58.550 --> 00:14:00.160
That's...

00:14:07.990 --> 00:14:09.580
She's here!

00:14:09.580 --> 00:14:10.970
One of the Valkyrur...

00:14:10.970 --> 00:14:12.800
Damn!

00:14:21.480 --> 00:14:23.520
Don't be afraid! Fire!

00:14:32.670 --> 00:14:34.460
What the hell is she?

00:14:34.460 --> 00:14:36.250
A monster?!

00:14:36.250 --> 00:14:38.040
Maximilian-sama,

00:14:38.040 --> 00:14:40.540
please leave the rest to me.

00:14:40.540 --> 00:14:45.040
Reporting! Troops on the front lines are currently engaging with a soldier who seems to be a Valkyria!

00:14:45.040 --> 00:14:46.240
What did you say?!

00:14:46.240 --> 00:14:48.170
A Valkyria?

00:14:50.590 --> 00:14:51.340
Can you guys do it?

00:14:56.160 --> 00:14:56.800
Yes!

00:15:00.810 --> 00:15:02.370
Okay!

00:15:02.370 --> 00:15:05.020
Concentrate all firepower in front of her!

00:15:11.690 --> 00:15:14.450
Even if she's a Valkyria, her body's still human...

00:15:14.450 --> 00:15:18.450
First, we have to attack head-on and force her to use her shield.

00:15:18.450 --> 00:15:20.490
Ask the other squads to cover us!

00:15:20.490 --> 00:15:21.860
Don't stop your attack!

00:15:21.860 --> 00:15:22.680
Yes, sir!

00:15:22.680 --> 00:15:23.660
Ian, Tappa!

00:15:24.170 --> 00:15:27.480
Get behind her! Ignore the tanks!

00:15:27.480 --> 00:15:29.250
Concentrate all attacks on the Valkyria!

00:15:29.250 --> 00:15:30.460
Yes, sir!

00:15:35.680 --> 00:15:37.840
All right! Attack!

00:15:37.840 --> 00:15:39.430
Crafty scum.

00:15:45.480 --> 00:15:46.350
Commander!

00:17:02.820 --> 00:17:05.440
Found him! It's a survivor!

00:17:18.520 --> 00:17:20.700
He's the only survivor?

00:17:21.900 --> 00:17:23.200
Faldio!

00:17:23.200 --> 00:17:26.100
Are you okay? What about your injuries?

00:17:26.100 --> 00:17:27.950
Hey, Faldio!

00:17:30.460 --> 00:17:32.070
What happened?

00:17:32.070 --> 00:17:33.710
Explain at once.

00:17:33.710 --> 00:17:35.450
Please wait.

00:17:35.450 --> 00:17:39.130
He's not in a state to answer any questions.

00:17:39.130 --> 00:17:42.480
Please wait just a bit longer for him to recover.

00:17:51.210 --> 00:17:53.690
This is war...

00:17:53.690 --> 00:17:56.550
I know! This is inevitable...

00:17:56.550 --> 00:17:57.780
It's inevitable, but...

00:17:57.780 --> 00:18:01.030
Still, that destructive power is unbelievable!

00:18:01.570 --> 00:18:04.450
Is that the Empire's newest weapon?

00:18:04.450 --> 00:18:05.490
Reporting in!

00:18:05.950 --> 00:18:09.540
The Valkyria from the Empire{Imperial Valkyria? or just remove the Empire portion?} is heading in this direction!

00:18:30.300 --> 00:18:32.440
Yes!

00:18:35.220 --> 00:18:36.710
Commander!

00:18:42.630 --> 00:18:43.920
Faldio?

00:18:53.910 --> 00:18:55.830
You're injured, right?

00:18:55.830 --> 00:18:58.380
You shouldn't. You need to rest in the infirmary.

00:19:01.970 --> 00:19:04.340
Ali...cia...

00:19:08.250 --> 00:19:09.740
Are you okay?

00:19:10.290 --> 00:19:12.380
How can you be?

00:19:12.380 --> 00:19:14.440
I asked something strange...

00:19:24.880 --> 00:19:25.990
Sorry.

00:19:28.760 --> 00:19:30.920
I'll help you anytime.

00:19:52.590 --> 00:19:53.850
Alicia...

00:19:54.510 --> 00:19:56.560
Sorry...

00:20:10.960 --> 00:20:14.620
My name is Maximilian Gaius von Reginrave.

00:20:14.620 --> 00:20:20.320
My only regret is that I am the second crown prince.

00:20:20.680 --> 00:20:25.070
I will avenge this insult myself.

00:20:25.070 --> 00:20:27.930
Next on Valkyria Chronicles,

00:20:27.930 --> 00:20:31.180
Chapter 21: Short-lived Bonds.

00:20:31.890 --> 00:20:34.210
Those who aim for the summit...

00:20:34.210 --> 00:20:36.140
may lose their forward path...

00:20:35.030 --> 00:20:40.010
Chapter 21

00:20:35.030 --> 00:20:40.010
Short-lived Bonds

00:20:36.140 --> 00:20:39.140
and find nothing behind them.
